? Where on the Bloch ball is the fully mixed state $I/2$? ;; North pole ;; On the equator ;; *At the centre ;; Outside the sphere || Its Bloch vector has length 0, purity 1/2 and entropy 1 bit.
? A qubit is $\tfrac{1}{2}|0\rangle+\tfrac{\sqrt3}{2}|1\rangle$. What is $P(1)$? ;; 1/2 ;; *3/4 ;; √3/2 ;; 1/4 || $|\sqrt3/2|^2 = 3/4$.
? Where is $|1\rangle$ on the Bloch sphere? ;; North pole ;; *South pole ;; Equator ;; Centre || North is $|0\rangle$, south is $|1\rangle$.
? Which of these can you observe? ;; Global phase ;; *Relative phase ;; Neither ;; Both always || Global phase is invisible; relative phase affects interference.
